*Summary:*

* country - Ukraine; value - not clarified. Technical integration.
* request from commerce to review a contract with a local payment provider that will facilitate payments between Bolt and a local bank;
* privacy and legal will coordinate on the ETA of the review; value currently unclear.

The ticket will be updated with more details after they become more clear.

*UPD (7.10):*

* the business owner believes no personal data is transferred with the provider; privacy is currently verifying this in the main ticket and requested the full description of data categories, which is currently not attached to the agreement;
