{quote}_Executor_ *(provider)* _hereby confirms that the provision of information services by the Executor will not involve the processing of Personal Data. “Personal Data” shall be defined as per the applicable definitions in Ukrainian law and under Article 4 of the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR). Should the processing of Personal Data become necessary for the provision of the agreed information services, the Executor must inform the Customer_ *(Bolt).* _In such an event, the Parties shall be deemed separate data controllers, each responsible for its own processing activities. Subsequently, the Parties shall enter into a separate agreement specifically governing the processing of Personal Data._{quote}

