* privacy was able to review the list of data transferred with the provider, and confirmed that *personal data will be processed (at least - Bolt user IP and user_ID, financial transaction information)*; 
* standard Bolt`s DSA (draft for non-EU markets) was shared with the supplier to ensure the personal data transfer is protected;

*UPD (23.12):*

* currently waiting for suppliers feedback.

*Last UPD (29.01.2025):*

* ticket closed due to inactivity. Ticket will be re-opened when the matter unfreezes - reached out to the stakeholders in the main ticket.

