Just for context, your request is to get the list of invoices issued by individual couriers? (Regardless of the legal type). I see this courier is not in a fleet. Perhaps, this [looker|https://bolt.cloud.looker.com/looks/7697?toggle=fil&qid=LNgkNPdzzODBbxUywUU4S5] can help you for queries from those accountants. 


